SCOPE

This file covers the source code of the Templix marketplace application in this
repository — the React front-end, the Supabase edge functions, the build and
maintenance scripts, and the accompanying documentation.

It does NOT cover the website templates sold through the marketplace. Each
template is distributed under the Templix Standard License, a separate document
included as LICENSE.txt inside every template download and published at
https://templix-peach.vercel.app/license. Nothing in this file grants, limits,
or alters the rights a customer receives with a template they downloaded or
bought.


